@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+Feature: Section visibility
+  As a user
+  I want the app to show relevant sections based on my todos
+  So that the interface stays clean
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with no existing todos
+
+  Scenario: Main section and footer are hidden when no todos exist
+    Then the main section is not visible
+    And the footer is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Main section and footer appear when a todo is added
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
